exports[`F01 file delivery workbench > F01-R04 snapshots true file metadata and explicit assembly selection 1`] = `"<p class="task-workbench-empty" role="status">文件交付服务暂不可用。连接后可上传原件和模板。</p><details class="delivery-assemble"><summary>按模板汇集数据</summary><form><fieldset><legend>选择完整来源范围</legend><div class="delivery-source-file"><strong>orders.xlsx</strong><div class="delivery-source-row"><label><input type="checkbox"/>Sheet1 · 80 × 2</label></div><div class="delivery-source-row"><label><input type="checkbox"/>Sheet2 · 1 × 2</label></div><div class="delivery-source-row"><label><input type="checkbox"/>Sheet3 · 1 × 2</label></div><div class="delivery-source-row"><label><input type="checkbox"/>Sheet4 · 1 × 2</label></div></div><label>XLSX 模板<select required=""><option value="template-1" selected="">template.xlsx</option></select></label><label>目标工作表<select required=""><option selected="">Sheet1</option><option>Sheet2</option><option>Sheet3</option><option>Sheet4</option></select></label><label>数据起始行<input type="number" min="1" max="100000" required="" value="2"/></label><p>同名匹配读取第一份已选来源的表头，以及目标起始行的上一行；汇集会读取每份来源表头后的全部行。</p><button type="button" disabled="">同名表头匹配</button><button type="button">添加列映射</button><label><span><input type="checkbox"/> 筛选、异常与分组汇总</span></label><label>交付文件名<input required="" maxLength="255" value="汇集结果.xlsx"/></label><button type="submit" disabled="">生成并保存 XLSX</button></fieldset></form></details><section class="delivery-preview" aria-label="表格文件预览"><header><strong>result.xlsx</strong><small>100 B · 已保存</small><small>版本 version-1</small><small>用户保存</small><div class="delivery-actions"><button type="button">下载原文件</button><button type="button">历史版本</button></div></header><details class="delivery-checks"><summary>文件验证与来源</summary><p>已验证 · 5 行写入 · 0 个公式</p><p>input-1 · Sheet1 · 读取 / 写入 / 空行排除: 7 / 5 / 0</p><p>input-1 · Sheet1 · 条件排除 / 异常: 1 / 1</p><p>B 合计: 370</p><small class="delivery-digest">sha256:bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb</small></details><label>工作表<select><option value="Sheet1" selected="">Sheet1 · 80 × 2</option><option value="Sheet2">Sheet2 · 1 × 2</option><option value="Sheet3">Sheet3 · 1 × 2</option><option value="Sheet4">Sheet4 · 1 × 2</option></select></label><p>点击单元格定向修改；保存会创建新版本。</p></section>"`;
